3. Apply the fix with edit_file, ONLY inside the padStart function.
4. Re-run the probe and confirm.
5. Run `cd /luxon && npx jest 2>&1 | tail -25` and confirm the failing set is unchanged (only the 2 ICU toFormat tests). Run `npx prettier --list-different src/impl/util.js` (must print nothing).
